768-- *Commander*: defaults to `-V`/`--version` and `-h`/`--help`, which matches the standard; declare subcommands for noun-verb and `.option('-v, --verbose', ..., (_, p) => p+1, 0)` for repeatable verbose.
769:- *oclif*: topic/command structure maps naturally to noun-verb; it provides help and plugin-based completion. Use `env-paths` for XDG-style locations and `process.exitCode` with the §6 codes; install a `process.stdout.on('error')` handler for `EPIPE` (R9.6).
770-
771----
